</picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a></li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span><br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> the potion to grant <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hastened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a> to all creatures in an area\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hastened\"> Condition: Hastened </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hastened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Creature has a +2 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, its <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a> increases by 9 m (30 ft),<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> and it can take one additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> per turn.</li>\n<li>When the condition ends, the creature becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lethargic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\">Lethargic</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by various merchants throughout the game with <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Potion_Table\" title=\"Utility Potion Table\">Utility Potion Table</a>; examples of merchants selling this item include:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/38px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/50px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cyrel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\">Cyrel</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road#Toll_House\" title=\"The Risen Road\">Risen Road Toll House</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/38px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/50px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roah Moonglow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>In the Harper cache hidden beneath the Scuffed Rock on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ravaged_Beach\" title=\"Ravaged Beach\">Ravaged Beach</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;141&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;280</span></li>\n<li>Carried by some <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" title=\"Mind Flayer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/25px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/38px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/50px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Flayers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png/25px-Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Portrait_Mind_Flayer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayers</a></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Salt</a> with<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashes_of_Hyena_Ear\" title=\"Ashes of Hyena Ear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Extract_Ashes_Pink_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ashes_of_Hyena_Ear\" title=\"Ashes of Hyena Ear\">Ashes of Hyena Ear</a>, which are procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hyena_Ear\" title=\"Hyena Ear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png/30px-Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png/40px-Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Hyena_Ear_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hyena_Ear\" title=\"Hyena Ear\">Hyena Ear</a>)</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hastened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a> effect ends, affected creatures normally receive the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lethargic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\">Lethargic</a> condition, causing them to miss their next turn.</li>\n<li>Using another Potion of Speed while already Hastened can effectively delay the Lethargic condition. When using a new Potion of Speed, the Hastened effect of the old one ends immediately, applying Lethargic right away, but Lethargic only lasts until the end of the current turn; if a creature is ready to end its turn (e.g. all actions are used) before consuming the second Potion of Speed (e.g. using the last <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/25px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/38px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/25px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Bonus action to drink the new one), then nothing is lost.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">Haste Spores</a> condition granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spore_Grenade\" title=\"Haste Spore Grenade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/GRN_Haste_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spore_Grenade\" title=\"Haste Spore Grenade\">Haste Spore Grenades</a> is similar to that of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hastened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a> condition granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Speed\" title=\"Potion of Speed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/POT_Potion_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">speed potions</a>, but only lasts 1 turn instead of 3, and does not leave users with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lethargic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\">Lethargic</a> condition when it expires, possibly increasing the utility of Haste Spore Grenades when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> over that of Potions of Speed.\n<ul><li>The price of a Haste Spore Grenade is 5 higher than that a Potion of Speed.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Potion of Speed has 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></td><td>Vulnerable</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.